    `all the constituent corporations entered into the agreement`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the terms and conditions of the merger or consolidation`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the mode of carrying the merger or consolidation into effect`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the amendments or changes in the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation, or that it stays as it is` IS A BOOLEAN
    `states that the certificate of incorporation of the resulting corporation is as set forth in an attachment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `some shares of a constituent corporation are to be converted into shares or other securities of the surviving or resulting corporation or cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the manner of converting or cancelling those shares`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `some shares of a constituent corporation are not to remain outstanding`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the holders of those shares are to receive cash, property, rights or securities of another corporation or entity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `states the cash, property, rights or securities of another corporation or entity that the holders are to receive` IS A BOOLEAN
    `contains a provision for cash in lieu of fractional shares, rights or other securities`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `that provision is consistent with s 155`                                                       IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: section 155 (piece dg3)
    `states what the laws of each jurisdiction under which a foreign constituent corporation is organized require to be set forth`  IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: the laws of the other jurisdictions

-- The surviving or resulting corporation being or not being a corporation of this State decides whether (b)(3) or (b)(4)
-- is needed: "In the case of a merger in which the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State".
