    AND `s 252(b)(6) the agreement's provision for cash in lieu of fractions is permitted` agreement

§§ `s 252(c) adoption, filing and the certificate`

-- "The agreement shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by each of the constituent corporations in
-- accordance with the laws under which it is organized, and, in the case of a corporation of this State, in the same manner as
-- is provided in section 251." The section 251 approval (dg6-s251a-agreement) is a MAYBE BOOLEAN: NOTHING if the vote cannot be counted.
-- src:1122 | The agreement shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by each of the constituent corporations in accordance with the laws under which it is organized, and, in the case of a corporation of this State, in the same manner as is provided in § 251 of this title. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(c) (src:1122)
GIVEN `the constituent corporation is a corporation of this State` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by the constituent corporation in accordance with the laws under which it is organized` IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: the laws of the other jurisdictions, for a foreign corporation
      `the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 251` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN -- the rule `s 251(a) the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 251`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 252(c) the constituent corporation has adopted and approved the agreement as the subsection requires` `the constituent corporation is a corporation of this State` `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by the constituent corporation in accordance with the laws under which it is organized` `the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 251` MEANS
    IF NOT `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by the constituent corporation in accordance with the laws under which it is organized`
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE IF `the constituent corporation is a corporation of this State`
         THEN `the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 251`
         ELSE JUST TRUE

-- "The agreement shall be filed and shall become effective for all purposes of the laws of this State when and as provided in
-- section 251 with respect to the merger or consolidation of corporations of this State."
-- src:1122 | The agreement shall be filed and shall become effective for all purposes of the laws of this State when and as provided in § 251 of this title with respect to the merger or consolidation of corporations of this State. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(c) (src:1122)
