GIVETH A DATE
`s 252(c) the date on which the agreement becomes effective for all purposes of the laws of this State` `the date on which a merger or consolidation of corporations of this State would become effective under s 251 (in accordance with s 103)` MEANS
    `the date on which a merger or consolidation of corporations of this State would become effective under s 251 (in accordance with s 103)`

