      `the service is made as the Secretary of State has prescribed`                       IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 252(d) service on the Secretary of State by electronic transmission is permitted` `process is served upon the Secretary of State by means of electronic transmission` `the service is made as the Secretary of State has prescribed` MEANS
    IF `process is served upon the Secretary of State by means of electronic transmission`
    THEN JUST `the service is made as the Secretary of State has prescribed`
    ELSE NOTHING

-- On service: the Secretary of State "shall forthwith notify" the corporation by letter to the address specified, or to the last
-- address it designated in writing for the purpose. "Forthwith" states no number of days, so no period is encoded.
-- src:1132 | In the event of such service upon the Secretary of State in accordance with this subsection, the Secretary of State shall forthwith notify such surviving or resulting corporation thereof by letter, directed to such surviving or resulting corporation at its address so specified, unless such surviving or resulting corporation shall have designated in writing to the Secretary of State a different address for such purpose, in which case it shall be mailed to the last address so designated. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(d) (src:1132)
GIVEN `process has been served upon the Secretary of State in accordance with s 252(d)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 252(d) the Secretary of State must notify the surviving or resulting corporation of the service` `process has been served upon the Secretary of State in accordance with s 252(d)` MEANS
    `process has been served upon the Secretary of State in accordance with s 252(d)`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(d) (src:1132)
DECLARE `s 252(d) Address for the Secretary of State's letter` IS ONE OF
    `the address specified in the agreement for mailing a copy of the process`
    `the last address that the corporation designated in writing to the Secretary of State for the purpose`

-- src:1132 | In the event of such service upon the Secretary of State in accordance with this subsection, the Secretary of State shall forthwith notify such surviving or resulting corporation thereof by letter, directed to such surviving or resulting corporation at its address so specified, unless such surviving or resulting corporation shall have designated in writing to the Secretary of State a different address for such purpose, in which case it shall be mailed to the last address so designated. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(d) (src:1132)
GIVEN `the corporation has designated in writing to the Secretary of State a different address for the purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 252(d) Address for the Secretary of State's letter`
`s 252(d) the address to which the Secretary of State must mail the letter` `the corporation has designated in writing to the Secretary of State a different address for the purpose` MEANS
    IF `the corporation has designated in writing to the Secretary of State a different address for the purpose`
    THEN `the last address that the corporation designated in writing to the Secretary of State for the purpose`
    ELSE `the address specified in the agreement for mailing a copy of the process`

-- The letter: sent by a mail or courier service with a record of mailing or deposit and a record of delivery evidenced by the
-- signature of the recipient, and enclosing a copy of the process and any other papers served.
-- src:1132 | Such letter shall be sent by a mail or courier service that includes a record of mailing or deposit with the courier and a record of delivery evidenced by the signature of the recipient. Such letter shall enclose a copy of the process and any other papers served on the Secretary of State pursuant to this subsection. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(d) (src:1132)
GIVEN `the letter is sent by a mail or courier service`                                                IS A BOOLEAN
      `the service includes a record of mailing or deposit with the courier`                           IS A BOOLEAN
      `the service includes a record of delivery evidenced by the signature of the recipient`          IS A BOOLEAN
      `the letter encloses a copy of the process and any other papers served on the Secretary of State` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 252(d) the letter is sent as the subsection requires` `the letter is sent by a mail or courier service` `the service includes a record of mailing or deposit with the courier` `the service includes a record of delivery evidenced by the signature of the recipient` `the letter encloses a copy of the process and any other papers served on the Secretary of State` MEANS
        `the letter is sent by a mail or courier service`
    AND `the service includes a record of mailing or deposit with the courier`
    AND `the service includes a record of delivery evidenced by the signature of the recipient`
    AND `the letter encloses a copy of the process and any other papers served on the Secretary of State`

-- The plaintiff's duty on such service: serve process and any other papers in duplicate, notify the Secretary of State that
-- service is being effected under the subsection, and pay the fee prescribed under section 391(a)(29) (dg11).
-- src:1132 | It shall be the duty of the plaintiff in the event of such service to serve process and any other papers in duplicate, to notify the Secretary of State that service is being effected pursuant to this subsection and to pay the Secretary of State a fee as prescribed under § 391(a)(29) of this title for the use of the State …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(d) (src:1132)
GIVEN `the plaintiff served process and any other papers in duplicate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the plaintiff notified the Secretary of State that service is being effected pursuant to s 252(d)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the amount the plaintiff paid the Secretary of State` IS A NUMBER
      `the fee prescribed under s 391(a)(29)`               IS A NUMBER -- out of range: section 391(a)(29) (piece dg11)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 252(d) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires` `the plaintiff served process and any other papers in duplicate` `the plaintiff notified the Secretary of State that service is being effected pursuant to s 252(d)` `the amount the plaintiff paid the Secretary of State` `the fee prescribed under s 391(a)(29)` MEANS
        `the plaintiff served process and any other papers in duplicate`
    AND `the plaintiff notified the Secretary of State that service is being effected pursuant to s 252(d)`
    AND `the amount the plaintiff paid the Secretary of State` EQUALS `the fee prescribed under s 391(a)(29)`

-- src:1132 | pay the Secretary of State a fee as prescribed under § 391(a)(29) of this title for the use of the State …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(d) (src:1132)
GIVEN `the fee prescribed under s 391(a)(29)` IS A NUMBER -- out of range: section 391(a)(29) (piece dg11)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 252(d) the fee the plaintiff must pay the Secretary of State` `the fee prescribed under s 391(a)(29)` MEANS
    `the fee prescribed under s 391(a)(29)`

-- "which sum shall be taxed as part of the costs in the proceeding, if the plaintiff shall prevail therein."
