-- The Secretary of State's alphabetical record of the service: one field per item the record sets forth.
-- src:1132 | The Secretary of State shall maintain an alphabetical record of any such service setting forth the name of the plaintiff and the defendant, the title, docket number and nature of the proceeding in which process has been served, the fact that service has been effected pursuant to this subsection, the return date thereof, and the day and hour service was made. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(d) (src:1132)
DECLARE `s 252(d) Record of a service of process` HAS
    `is kept alphabetically`                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `sets forth the name of the plaintiff and the defendant`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `sets forth the title, docket number and nature of the proceeding in which process has been served` IS A BOOLEAN
    `sets forth the fact that service has been effected pursuant to s 252(d)`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `sets forth the return date`                                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `sets forth the day and hour service was made`                              IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:1132 | The Secretary of State shall maintain an alphabetical record of any such service setting forth the name of the plaintiff and the defendant, the title, docket number and nature of the proceeding in which process has been served, the fact that service has been effected pursuant to this subsection, the return date thereof, and the day and hour service was made. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(d) (src:1132)
GIVEN record IS A `s 252(d) Record of a service of process`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 252(d) the Secretary of State's record of the service is what the subsection requires` record MEANS
        record's `is kept alphabetically`
    AND record's `sets forth the name of the plaintiff and the defendant`
    AND record's `sets forth the title, docket number and nature of the proceeding in which process has been served`
    AND record's `sets forth the fact that service has been effected pursuant to s 252(d)`
    AND record's `sets forth the return date`
    AND record's `sets forth the day and hour service was made`

-- "The Secretary of State shall not be required to retain such information longer than 5 years from receipt of the service of
-- process": through the day 5 years after receipt the record must be kept (keel fork F3; NOTES.md fork F12).
-- src:1132 | The Secretary of State shall not be required to retain such information longer than 5 years from receipt of the service of process.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(d) (src:1132)
GIVEN `the date on which the service of process was received` IS A DATE
      `the date asked about`                                  IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 252(d) the Secretary of State is required to retain the record` `the date on which the service of process was received` `the date asked about` MEANS
    `the date asked about` AT MOST (`the date` (`period in years` 5) `after` `the date on which the service of process was received`)

§§ `s 252(e) sections of s 251 that apply`

-- "Section 251(d) shall apply to any merger or consolidation under this section; section 251(e) shall apply to a merger under
-- this section in which the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State; and section 251(f) and (h) shall apply to any
-- merger under this section."
-- src:1133 | (e) Section 251(d) of this title shall apply to any merger or consolidation under this section; § 251(e) of this title shall apply to a merger under this section in which the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State; and § 251(f) and (h) of this title shall apply to any merger under this section.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(e) (src:1133)
GIVEN kind IS A `s 251 Kind of combination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 252(e) s 251(d) applies to the merger or consolidation` kind MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `a merger into a single surviving corporation`     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation` THEN TRUE

-- src:1133 | (e) Section 251(d) of this title shall apply to any merger or consolidation under this section; § 251(e) of this title shall apply to a merger under this section in which the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State; and § 251(f) and (h) of this title shall apply to any merger under this section.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 252(e) (src:1133)
GIVEN kind                                                               IS A `s 251 Kind of combination`
      `the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State`         IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 252(e) s 251(e) applies to the merger` kind `the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `a merger into a single surviving corporation`     THEN `the surviving corporation is a corporation of this State`
    WHEN `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation` THEN FALSE

